{"allowed_english": [], "context": {"approved_glossary_entries": [], "generation_contexts": [{"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:02KN:paragraph/0001", "hash": "sha256:6e536194dc4b71c81c290ed7d4e2b7c5867e9f132eba497d8bc4261c40f91ba1", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 199155, "byte_start": 198148, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:d573dc3623aa68a2e9a534f1a6b0af31114a3257df1c1db95bebef5a7a27f648", "line_end": 5307, "line_start": 5285}, "owner_tag": "02KN", "parent_tag": "02KN", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02KN", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$g : Y' \\to Y$", "MATH_0003": "$f' : X' \\to Y'$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$g$", "MATH_0006": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nX' \\ar[d]_{f'} \\ar[r]_{g'} & X \\ar[d]^f \\\\\nY' \\ar[r]^g & Y\n}\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{P}(f) \\Rightarrow \\mathcal{P}(f')$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{P}(f') \\Rightarrow \\mathcal{P}(f)$", "MATH_0010": "$g$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0012": "$g$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0014": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0015": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-descending-properties}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:52be441bf232cb234e8fc0912c9a40ab7156996a9478568be315aba5a8e3460b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c76ed646b9352a3fa50531a3900677213eb7c6d8e33904dc84e3d33a8ee6cc04", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nSuppose that <MATH_0001> is a morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0003> be the base change of <MATH_0004> by <MATH_0005>:\n<MATH_0006>\nLet <MATH_0007> be a property of morphisms of schemes.\nThen we can wonder if (a) <MATH_0008>,\nand also whether the converse (b) <MATH_0009>\nis true. If (a) holds whenever <MATH_0010> is flat, then we say <MATH_0011>\nis preserved under flat base change. If (b) holds whenever <MATH_0012> is\nsurjective and flat, then we say <MATH_0013> descends through\nflat surjective base changes. If <MATH_0014> is preserved under\nflat base changes and descends through flat surjective base changes,\nthen we say <MATH_0015> is flat local on the target.\nCompare with the discussion in\nSection <REF_0001>.\nThis turns out to be a very important notion which\nwe formalize in the following definition.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8323c2ee4a2f44cc75c6256359bb8ca447ad8f1a4315eb582ba252fb1b6b4e7f", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:02KN:paragraph/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:02KN:paragraph/0002", "hash": "sha256:4cf36cc5db3e95b605998cc2ca90f01dde963caeec8ef29debda27a778d8bd78", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 200156, "byte_start": 199797, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:718baa4651367e7c9e87744b881b4def8166d8d4b05fa098103a2e5cfe116a93", "line_end": 5333, "line_start": 5327}, "owner_tag": "02KN", "parent_tag": "02KN", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02KN", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0002": "$X \\to Y$", "MATH_0003": "$X' \\to Y'$", "MATH_0004": "$X \\to Y$", "MATH_0005": "$\\tau$", "MATH_0006": "$\\tau$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:5f45c720fd6cfd86d598936488760e40cf997cf96795b91da8ee5633b5ecb810", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5752f0d1942fa0e59487116dedd8c439afe87bb89903a1d35de844511dd58c78", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nTo be sure, since isomorphisms are always coverings\nwe see (or require) that property <MATH_0001> holds for <MATH_0002>\nif and only if it holds for any arrow <MATH_0003> isomorphic to <MATH_0004>.\nIf a property is <MATH_0005>-local on the target then it is preserved\nby base changes by morphisms which occur in <MATH_0006>-coverings. Here\nis a formal statement.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3ea4c965efeed492e171decb2f2a1106004c3c93b29ff8806699354e984652ac", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:02KN:paragraph/0002"}}}, {"context_id": "reference:topologies-section-procedure", "hash": "sha256:55dd57c488764ee508e189074b3f4ef905d831bd6c934a59a76abffdf49b12a0", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 772, "byte_start": 715, "file": "topologies.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:2c86268a86107593f385643557040601977af73163f60ee3c3050249eac54cac", "line_end": 32, "line_start": 31}, "owner_tag": "020M", "parent_tag": "020M", "requested_label": "topologies-section-procedure", "requested_tag": "020M", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "topologies", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "020M", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{section-procedure}", "TEXTCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTOPEN_0001": "\\section{"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:56750e3ce08a6c2d64a3c47319e08d18776d2f1ce301b5975a3a586a8558b35b", "source_text": "<TEXTOPEN_0001>The general procedure<TEXTCLOSE_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7fbf0e9d4a5881136a7c686673d331fbd957cbabdb224f8ad4d084bf894d1738", "unit_id": "inventory:topologies:020M:section_title/0001"}}}], "input_freeze": {"hash": "sha256:3c3e24456245dd37316d46df60604813edcc231afa10a3def0e07f183543da64", "path": "translation-data/sour